OL,3,GNEWSARobber jailed after being tackled
OL,4,Aby shop worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FCCTV footage of a shop worker
OL,7,Fsuccessfully tackling a robber who
OL,8,Fburst into her workplace and tried to
OL,9,Fsteal a cash register has been released
OL,10,Fby police.
OL,12,FKai Holtzhausen, 39, tried to raid the
OL,13,FSubway restaurant in Farnham Road,
OL,14,FSlough, but was quickly confronted by
OL,15,Fan employee who tried to stop him
OL,16,Fescaping.
OL,18,FThe woman in her 20s persisted,
OL,19,Fsuffering bruising and a cut to her
OL,20,Farm, and was helped by a witness who
OL,21,Fwas passing the shop before Holtzhausen
OL,22,Feventually left empty handed.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
